# Real human WAXAL recordings (CC-BY-4.0/CC-BY-SA-4.0), baked into the
# backend Docker image as the MOS listening test's ground-truth anchor -- see
# data/mos_ground_truth/ATTRIBUTION.md. Small (~2.7MB total), unlike the
# scratch/training audio the blanket *.wav rule above exists to keep out.
!data/mos_ground_truth/*.wav

